<title>UK: Granada and Futuremedia in marketing deal.</title>
<headline>Granada and Futuremedia in marketing deal.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Granada Business Technology (GBT), part of media and leisure group Granada, has signed a joint marketing deal with Futuremedia Plc,  Futuremedia said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Futuremedia, an international multimedia company, and GBT plan to develop and distribute products for the leisure and retail sectors.</p>
<p>The first product - ASCARI -- is a communications system tailored to provide an effective screen-based link for employees and customers.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
